WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:24.448
The cues to distinguish camera-body mechanical assembly are the visibility of an open camera body or a mechanical subassembly and observation of hands or a tool acting on that assembly.

2
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:35.068
The sensor-handling stage asks you to observe the close handling or examination of an exposed sensor-like rectangular optical surface.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.560
For the enclosure closure, look for the visible alignment and fitting of a shell or plate onto the partly assembled camera body, and ensure it covers previously exposed internals.
